  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On Fang Yuan’s list of wanted immortal materials, most are refinement path immortal materials: the varieties are huge and the types chaotic. Only refinement path Gu Immortals bother to prepare such a list to gain something from the auction.",
      "chapters": [
        753
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "auction-demand-list",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Refinement path Immortal Gu use a large amount of refinement path immortal materials, and as a refinement path venerable Fang Yuan’s control over those materials is a hundred percent. Refinement path immortal materials contain refinement path dao marks and are subject to his ability to refine natural refinement path dao marks of the outside world.",
      "chapters": [
        2224
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "perfect-control",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_refinement",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Advance refinement Gu is a refinement path Immortal Gu: even though some rule path immortal materials are needed, refinement path immortal materials are the bulk of its components. As a refinement path venerable Fang Yuan can perfectly process refinement path immortal materials, which raises the success rate.",
      "chapters": [
        2247
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "bulk-of-advance-refinement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_advance_refinement_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It is much easier for Fang Yuan to process refinement path immortal materials than to handle wood path immortal materials.",
      "chapters": [
        2250
